{"sha": "7fa95e753185e8068efec37dc3cd27a175d67b24b9bf4726438107982240fdc3", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:integ} 章 --- 积分}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:integ:1}", "\\[", "\\int_1^2 \\left(3x^2 - \\frac{1}{x^2}\\right)\\dd x", "= \\left[x^3 + \\frac1x\\right]_1^2 = \\left(8 + \\tfrac12\\right) - 2 = \\frac{13}{2}.", "\\]", "\\[", "\\int_0^{\\pi/2} \\cos t\\,\\dd t = \\bigl[\\sin t\\bigr]_0^{\\pi/2} = 1 .", "\\]", "设 $u = 2t+1$，$\\frac{1}{2t+1} = \\frac12\\,\\frac{u'}{u}$：", "\\[", "\\int_0^1 \\frac{\\dd t}{2t+1} = \\frac12\\bigl[\\ln(2t+1)\\bigr]_0^1", "= \\frac{\\ln 3}{2}.", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:integ:2}", "$x\\,\\eu^{x^2} = \\frac12\\,(x^2)'\\,\\eu^{x^2}$ 的原函数为", "$\\frac12\\eu^{x^2} + c$。条件 $F(0) = 1$ 给出 $\\frac12 + c = 1$，", "于是", "\\[", "F(x) = \\frac{\\eu^{x^2} + 1}{2}.", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:integ:3}", "\\[", "\\mu = \\frac{1}{\\pi}\\int_0^\\pi \\sin t\\,\\dd t", "= \\frac{1}{\\pi}\\bigl[-\\cos t\\bigr]_0^\\pi = \\frac{2}{\\pi} \\approx 0.64 .", "\\]", "从图形上看，底为 $\\intcc{0}{\\pi}$、高为", "$\\frac{2}{\\pi}$ 的矩形与正弦曲线的一拱面积相等。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:integ:4}", "取 $u' = 1$，$v = \\ln t$，则 $u = t$，$v' = \\frac1t$：", "\\[", "\\int_1^{\\eu} \\ln t\\,\\dd t = \\bigl[t\\ln t\\bigr]_1^{\\eu} - \\int_1^{\\eu} 1\\,\\dd t", "= \\eu - (\\eu - 1) = 1 .", "\\]", "取 $u' = \\sin t$，$v = t$，则 $u = -\\cos t$，$v' = 1$：", "\\[", "\\int_0^\\pi t\\sin t\\,\\dd t = \\bigl[-t\\cos t\\bigr]_0^\\pi + \\int_0^\\pi \\cos t\\,\\dd t", "= \\pi + 0 = \\pi .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:integ:5}", "两曲线的交点满足 $x^2 = x + 2$，\\emph{即} $x \\in \\{-1, 2\\}$，且", "在 $\\intcc{-1}{2}$ 上直线位于抛物线上方，面积为", "\\[", "\\int_{-1}^{2} \\bigl(x + 2 - x^2\\bigr)\\dd x", "= \\left[\\frac{x^2}{2} + 2x - \\frac{x^3}{3}\\right]_{-1}^{2}", "= \\frac{10}{3} - \\left(-\\frac{7}{6}\\right) = \\frac{9}{2}.", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:integ:6}", "\\emph{1.} $I = \\bigl[\\ln(1+t)\\bigr]_0^1 = \\ln 2$.", "", "\\emph{2.}", "\\[", "I_n + I_{n+1} = \\int_0^1 \\frac{t^n(1 + t)}{1+t}\\,\\dd t", "= \\int_0^1 t^n \\,\\dd t = \\frac{1}{n+1}.", "\\]", "在 $\\intcc{0}{1}$ 上，$0 \\leq \\dfrac{t^n}{1+t} \\leq t^n$，由比较可得", "$0 \\leq I_n \\leq \\frac{1}{n+1}$。", "", "\\emph{3.} 由递推关系，经逐项相消的归纳可得", "\\[", "I_n = (-1)^n\\left(I_0 - \\left(1 - \\frac12 + \\dots + \\frac{(-1)^{n-1}}{n}\\right)\\right),", "\\]", "\\emph{即}", "$\\displaystyle\\sum_{k=1}^{n} \\frac{(-1)^{k-1}}{k} = \\ln 2 - (-1)^n I_n$", "（回顾 $I_0 = \\ln 2$）。由 $\\abs{I_n} \\leq \\frac{1}{n+1} \\to 0$，", "交错调和级数的和趋于 $\\ln 2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:integ:7}", "路程：", "\\[", "d = \\int_0^{100} 30\\left(1 - \\eu^{-t/50}\\right)\\dd t", "= 30\\left[t + 50\\,\\eu^{-t/50}\\right]_0^{100}", "= 30\\left(100 + 50\\eu^{-2} - 50\\right)", "= 1500 + 1500\\,\\eu^{-2}.", "\\]", "数值上 $d \\approx 1500 + 203 = 1703$ 米。平均速度：", "$\\frac{d}{100} = 15\\bigl(1 + \\eu^{-2}\\bigr) \\approx 17.0$ 米/秒。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:integ:8}", "\\emph{1.} $S_n$ 是 $n$ 个宽为 $\\frac1n$ 的矩形面积之和，", "高分别为 $f\\left(\\frac kn\\right)$，$k = 1, \\dots, n$，其中", "$f(t) = \\frac{1}{1+t}$：它是 “右端点”矩形法", "$f$ 在 $\\intcc{0}{1}$ 上曲线下方面积的近似。", "", "\\emph{2.} $f$ 递减，所以在每个区间", "$\\intcc{\\frac{k-1}{n}}{\\frac kn}$ 上，", "$f\\left(\\frac kn\\right) \\leq f(t) \\leq f\\left(\\frac{k-1}{n}\\right)$；", "对上述不等式积分并对 $k$ 求和：", "\\[", "S_n \\leq \\int_0^1 f(t)\\,\\dd t \\leq S_n + \\frac1n\\bigl(f(0) - f(1)\\bigr)", "= S_n + \\frac{1}{2n}.", "\\]", "（习题展示式中的中间项，", "当 $f(0) - f(1) = 1 - \\frac12$ 时，即为此界。）因此", "$0 \\leq \\ln 2 - S_n \\leq \\frac{1}{2n} \\to 0$，故 $S_n \\to \\ln 2$。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}